<title>USA: US debt futures consolidate to close mostly higher.</title>
<headline>US debt futures consolidate to close mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 27 - U.S. debt futures consolidated to close mostly higher. The 0.9-pct rise in the weekly Redbook Retail Sales Index was slightly lower than expected, and had little affect on the market. Analysts said two-yr note sale was slightly disappointing.</p>
<p>Derivatives Desk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
